{"type":"system","subtype":"task_notification","task_id":"a18bae22e2e763d72","run_id":"0mvpk4whw-153e4722","tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b302c4c03b6016e6","status":"completed","output_file":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-private-var-folders-h5-l8qslbp55w5621qf9ngsh5jc0000gn-T-epic-RHAISTRAT-9016-gdlqtd01/f85c7355-3df5-4b14-a439-1adff2ae9aec/tasks/a18bae22e2e763d72.output","summary":"Decomposition of RHAISTRAT-9016 is complete. The validator printed `OK` and `decompose_complete=true` is set.\n\n**Triage outcome:** Below-threshold did not apply — although the only active component is the web console (notebook controller and Kubeflow Pipelines are passive read-only data sources), HLR-4 is substantive documentation authoring, a distinct work stream alongside code implementation.\n\n**Decomposition (2 epics, critical path length 2):**\n\n- `RHAISTRAT-9016-E001` — Implementation, component `Dashboard`, team RHOAI Dashboard, P1, no dependencies. Delivers both reports (idle-workbench from notebook-controller activity tracking, stale pipeline-runs from KFP metadata with configurable age) plus CSV export. HLR-3 (P2, CSV export) is kept bundled — recorded at the traceability row with inline rationale (same report surfaces and data paths, not independently schedulable). Passive-component validation is an AC on this epic (report values must match source-system data).\n- `RHAISTRAT-9016-E002` — Implementation with `implementation_type: docs-authoring`, component `Documentation`, P2 (strategy priority Normal), depends on E001 per Rule 11. Covers HLR-4 with a content outline inside `## Scope` and a \"technically reviewed against implementation\" AC (Rule 24).\n\n**No Investigation epics** — Open Questions is explicitly \"None\"; no conditional ADRs or pending reviews. **No onboarding chain** — Dashboard is already Konflux-onboarded per architecture context.\n\n**Component mappings** (logged in the summary): RHOAI web console → `Dashboard`, Notebook controller → `Notebooks`, Kubeflow Pipelines → `Data Science Pipelines`, all verbatim from `.context/rhai-components.txt`.\n\n**Health warnings recorded:** strategy is missing Impacted Teams, Dependencies, Given/When/Then ACs, and NFR sections (proceeded from HLRs/Out of Scope; teams taken from architecture context); E002's team assignment (RHOAI Dashboard) is an assumption flagged for confirmation.\n\n**Artifacts written** (all in `artifacts/epic-tasks/`): `RHAISTRAT-9016-decomposition.md`, `RHAISTRAT-9016-E001.md`, `RHAISTRAT-9016-E002.md`, plus per-epic signal rationales `RHAISTRAT-9016-E001-ai-signals.md` and `RHAISTRAT-9016-E002-ai-signals.md`.","usage":{"total_tokens":34259,"tool_uses":21,"duration_ms":193483},"uuid":"ae62cd34-4af8-47c2-b054-520889ff0908","session_id":"f85c7355-3df5-4b14-a439-1adff2ae9aec"}
