ehavior. No rule-mandated AC is missing: this is not a\n91\treplacement epic (no rollback/feature-flag AC required) and there is no konflux chain\n92\t(component already onboarded). No AC states an externally-controlled precondition — each\n93\tAC conditions on what the epic itself builds or verifies. No epic body references sibling\n94\tepics by draft ID.\n95\t\n96\t### 7. Completeness (2/2)\n97\tAll strategy scope is accounted for: both P1 reports, the configurable staleness age,\n98\tCSV export, and documentation with safe reclamation steps (the latter framed to match the\n99\tno-automated-reclamation exclusion). The Out of Scope items (automated reclamation,\n100\tcost/chargeback) are carried into E001's Scope and AC 6 rather than silently dropped.\n101\tThe strategy's problem-statement context (reclaiming capacity with confidence) is carried\n102\tinto E002's scope. Missing strategy sections (no Impacted Teams, Dependencies, GWT ACs,\n103\tor NFR section) are explicitly recorded in Health Warnings rather than ignored. The\n104\tstrategy states no bounded-uncertainty outcomes, so no conditional branches are required.\n105\tHLR-4 requires documentation and a docs-authoring epic exists.\n106\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-92f4af1213898c59","agent_id":"a31cc189cf4d4d58c","session_id":"f85c7355-3df5-4b14-a439-1adff2ae9aec","uuid":"cda38dca-d0fe-4b13-89c6-a6fe246570d4","timestamp":"2026-10-26T18:01:06.553Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-bc489ac2b179185b","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9016 epics"}
